# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

outInt32 is project
outInt32 purpose "An audit program just outside the stage0 subset, which refined accepts; stage0 refuses it"
outInt32 target console
outInt32 version "0.1.0"
outInt32 language refined 1
outInt32 standardLibrary 1
outInt32 allows write console.stdout none
outInt32 requires none
outInt32 includesModule outInt32
outInt32 entry outInt32.main
